WEBVTT

01:28.250 --> 01:32.090
Our Secret
EP23

01:43.690 --> 01:44.520
This is

01:45.890 --> 01:47.649
confidential. You shouldn't read it.

01:51.649 --> 01:52.440
So,

01:53.399 --> 01:55.890
because of my royalties of half a million yuan,

01:56.720 --> 01:58.330
you signed this indenture.

01:58.330 --> 01:59.369
No way.

02:01.400 --> 02:02.840
You don't owe me.

02:03.720 --> 02:05.120
Why did I do it because of you?

02:06.720 --> 02:09.440
Why are you still lying to me?

02:10.160 --> 02:12.330
You don't tell me anything.

02:15.330 --> 02:16.890
I'm not lying.

02:18.050 --> 02:19.330
I decided to join in Hongguang

02:19.770 --> 02:21.080
because it

02:21.850 --> 02:23.920
has a promising future.

02:24.850 --> 02:26.719
You've been so busy lately

02:27.560 --> 02:29.770
for this project?

02:32.969 --> 02:34.050
I'm sorry to

02:35.770 --> 02:38.690
complain to you so much.

02:39.610 --> 02:40.610
What are you talking about?

02:43.560 --> 02:45.330
You're my girlfriend.

02:45.850 --> 02:47.160
It's my duty

02:47.490 --> 02:48.770
to protect you.

02:52.520 --> 02:54.280
Don't always say sorry to me.

02:54.800 --> 02:55.770
Get it?

03:04.440 --> 03:05.560
Silly girl.

03:10.770 --> 03:12.410
Well, I'm gonna pack up my stuff.

03:12.850 --> 03:13.890
Don't overthink.

03:17.610 --> 03:18.690
I'll sleep on the couch.

03:41.080 --> 03:42.360
Zhou Siyue.

03:44.080 --> 03:45.850
I can't sleep.

03:50.360 --> 03:52.969
Do you want to come and sleep over here?

03:58.360 --> 04:00.080
Don't overthink.

04:43.930 --> 04:45.090
We'll take different sides.

05:40.960 --> 05:41.720
Hey,

05:41.720 --> 05:44.210
why is your heart beating so fast?

06:12.440 --> 06:13.610
Sleep tight.

06:50.400 --> 06:51.280
Tell me.

06:51.490 --> 06:52.530
Where have you been last night?

06:53.120 --> 06:54.240
Tell me the truth!

06:54.440 --> 06:55.280
We'll be lenient if you confess,

06:55.530 --> 06:56.490
but if you refuse to, you'll find out what we get.

06:57.120 --> 06:58.650
Why was your cell phone turned off?

06:59.440 --> 07:00.160
Did you guys have...?

07:00.160 --> 07:00.890
No.

07:01.160 --> 07:01.680
No problem!

07:01.680 --> 07:02.280
Tell us!

07:09.160 --> 07:12.000
I went out to dinner with Zhou Siyue yesterday.

07:12.280 --> 07:14.680
It's too late and the dorm was closed.

07:15.490 --> 07:16.770
So,

07:17.050 --> 07:18.400
where did you stay overnight?

07:19.650 --> 07:21.210
In his basement.

07:21.890 --> 07:23.090
Basement.

07:23.400 --> 07:26.160
Did you two do that?

07:32.400 --> 07:33.810
I thought you

07:34.160 --> 07:35.490
were worried about my safety.

07:36.090 --> 07:37.890
I didn't expect you to be so nosy.

07:38.049 --> 07:38.890
Tell us, please.

07:39.330 --> 07:40.440
So, we can know

07:40.930 --> 07:42.530
if we succeed in transforming you.

07:43.530 --> 07:44.530
No.

07:44.890 --> 07:46.370
We didn't do anything.

07:49.330 --> 07:50.720
Why are you so disappointed?

07:53.720 --> 07:56.049
I think we're doing well.

07:56.720 --> 07:57.610
And,

07:59.560 --> 08:00.840
for some things,

08:01.160 --> 08:02.960
I should take my time and slow down.

08:04.370 --> 08:05.840
Take your time?

08:06.650 --> 08:07.720
Slow down?

08:12.120 --> 08:13.090
Is it Zhou Siyue?

08:13.240 --> 08:14.650
Now you're in a hurry, right?

08:17.680 --> 08:18.530
Hello.

08:19.120 --> 08:19.810
Hi.

08:19.810 --> 08:21.810
Do you know Zhou Siyue?

08:22.120 --> 08:23.090
What's the matter?

08:23.680 --> 08:25.280
This is Jiangling Public Security Bureau.

08:25.280 --> 08:27.280
Zhou Siyue is suspected of revealing company secrets,

08:27.280 --> 08:28.000
and he is summoned.

08:31.960 --> 08:33.210
Hongguang Technology thinks that

08:33.210 --> 08:33.890
there may be insiders

08:33.890 --> 08:34.920
giving out company secrets.

08:35.480 --> 08:37.360
It is reported that Hongguang Technology

08:37.360 --> 08:39.330
invested and participated in many experimental projects.

08:40.170 --> 08:41.290
Hongguang Technology said

08:41.530 --> 08:43.210
they will not tolerate competitors

08:43.210 --> 08:44.799
viciously disturbing the market,

08:45.330 --> 08:47.480
and will cooperate with the police investigation.

08:47.970 --> 08:48.920
Suspect Zhou

08:49.170 --> 08:50.890
is suspected of revealing company secrets,

08:50.890 --> 08:52.530
and has been taken into police custody. He will be sued.

08:52.530 --> 08:54.170
Dear, are you okay?

08:55.120 --> 08:56.090
Nurse!

08:56.090 --> 08:57.680
Nurse, come and check him!

09:11.120 --> 09:12.090
Hello, mom.

09:12.090 --> 09:13.090
Xianxian.

09:15.120 --> 09:16.600
How are you doing?

09:17.680 --> 09:20.560
I just helped him ask for leave from school today.

09:21.170 --> 09:22.090
Other things

09:22.600 --> 09:23.970
are all under progress.

09:24.850 --> 09:25.970
I was asking

09:26.290 --> 09:27.560
how you are doing.

09:29.090 --> 09:29.920
Me?

09:31.290 --> 09:32.680
I'm doing fine.

09:33.330 --> 09:34.290
Don't worry.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.330
Xianxian.

09:36.410 --> 09:38.210
Take care of yourself.

09:38.530 --> 09:39.410
Don't wear yourself out.

09:40.000 --> 09:43.560
If you do, Mom, Dad and he

09:43.770 --> 09:44.800
will be so worried.

09:47.170 --> 09:48.000
Don't worry.

09:50.240 --> 09:51.800
If that's all, I have to go.

10:04.120 --> 10:06.410
Red Horse wanted me to infiltrate Hongguang,

10:07.120 --> 10:08.440
and steal information

10:08.770 --> 10:09.890
about Hongguang for them.

10:11.120 --> 10:12.090
But, I've already

10:12.090 --> 10:14.210
rejected their proposal clearly.

10:14.290 --> 10:15.240
Then why does

10:15.240 --> 10:16.650
Red Horse's source code of the new project

10:17.000 --> 10:18.600
highly resemble

10:18.850 --> 10:20.040
the source code of the project you did for Hongguang?

10:24.330 --> 10:26.120
I told him thousands of times that

10:26.560 --> 10:28.210
it should be done without any traces.

10:28.770 --> 10:31.170
Why did he still get caught?

10:34.440 --> 10:36.120
When you intended to use Hongguang's information

10:36.120 --> 10:37.560
to release your product,

10:39.120 --> 10:41.240
you should have expected this.

10:41.530 --> 10:43.410
You're here to lecture me?

10:44.850 --> 10:47.000
He knows too much.

10:48.800 --> 10:49.850
Get him a lawyer right now,

10:49.970 --> 10:50.970
and get him out of there.

10:51.360 --> 10:53.040
He mustn't breathe a word.

11:01.530 --> 11:03.120
Mr. Su, someone wants to see you.

11:05.530 --> 11:06.240
Go do your job.

11:06.240 --> 11:06.970
Okay.

11:20.240 --> 11:21.210
Xianxian.

11:23.240 --> 11:26.680
I'm here for Zhou Siyue.

11:29.000 --> 11:30.040
Have a seat, please.

11:40.120 --> 11:41.170
I'm sorry, Xianxian.

11:41.770 --> 11:42.970
This is the only thing

11:43.330 --> 11:44.240
that I can't help you.

11:46.170 --> 11:47.040
I understand.

11:47.970 --> 11:50.410
After all, it's your company.

11:51.000 --> 11:52.650
Xianxian, that's not what I meant.

11:52.970 --> 11:53.970
Except for this,

11:54.120 --> 11:55.850
I can help you with anything else.

12:07.560 --> 12:08.920
You and students of Huaqing University

12:08.920 --> 12:10.850
have so many cooperative projects?

12:14.730 --> 12:15.530
I have to go.

12:20.240 --> 12:20.920
Xianxian.

12:45.920 --> 12:46.730
Zhang.

12:47.170 --> 12:48.970
Hand that folder over to me, please.

12:49.600 --> 12:50.650
Professor Ye.

12:52.120 --> 12:53.120
Hi, Professor Ye.

13:04.410 --> 13:05.240
Auntie.

13:06.040 --> 13:06.970
Xianxian.

13:07.530 --> 13:08.770
Why are you here?

13:09.090 --> 13:10.800
I've been so busy recently that

13:11.290 --> 13:12.970
I didn't get any chance to see you.

13:14.090 --> 13:15.360
I was inconsiderate.

13:16.290 --> 13:17.920
I should have come and visited you.

13:17.920 --> 13:19.000
Don't say that.

13:19.480 --> 13:22.360
I'm so happy you came here.

13:23.000 --> 13:24.560
Have a seat.

13:35.890 --> 13:37.290
Time flies.

13:38.040 --> 13:40.730
You kids have all grown up.

13:44.680 --> 13:47.170
Actually, we as parents

13:48.000 --> 13:50.360
don't want you to push yourselves so hard.

13:50.650 --> 13:51.680
Take some time

13:52.290 --> 13:54.090
to sit and chat with us like this.

13:55.330 --> 13:57.210
Because, we are growing old, too.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.120
We're always worried that maybe

14:00.000 --> 14:01.410
sometime in the future,

14:02.210 --> 14:04.240
we won't have any chance to talk.

14:04.730 --> 14:05.680
No, it can't be.

14:10.000 --> 14:10.920
Hey.

14:12.210 --> 14:14.360
I'm always so sentimental.

14:15.600 --> 14:17.530
If they two saw it,

14:18.090 --> 14:20.360
they would laugh at me.

14:22.120 --> 14:24.090
You have to keep it a secret for me.

14:27.360 --> 14:28.410
Auntie,

14:28.890 --> 14:31.170
uncle will be fine.

14:32.680 --> 14:34.120
Thank you, Xianxian.

14:38.090 --> 14:39.170
Ding Xian.

14:39.890 --> 14:41.560
I just got off the phone with the lawyer.

14:41.560 --> 14:42.730
I have something to tell you.

14:43.480 --> 14:44.600
Go ahead.

14:45.650 --> 14:47.090
Auntie, I'll have a talk with him.

14:52.970 --> 14:54.000
Siyue is now

14:55.800 --> 14:57.560
considered as the prime suspect.

14:59.560 --> 15:01.090
Because, in the entire project team,

15:01.290 --> 15:04.000
he's the only one that had contacted with Red Horse Tech's people.

15:05.290 --> 15:07.410
He did that because of me.

15:07.680 --> 15:08.730
Don't think too much.

15:09.210 --> 15:10.530
Cooperating with Hongguang

15:10.680 --> 15:12.530
was a good opportunity for him.

15:12.920 --> 15:14.850
There's one more thing I forgot to tell you.

15:15.800 --> 15:17.410
Before Siyue was taken away,

15:19.000 --> 15:20.650
he asked me to give this to you.

15:33.560 --> 15:34.680
Where's Zhou Zongtang's relative?

15:35.680 --> 15:36.530
I'm here.

15:37.040 --> 15:38.480
The operation was a success. Don't worry.

15:39.210 --> 15:39.850
Thank you.

15:39.920 --> 15:40.290
Thank you, nurse.

15:40.290 --> 15:40.890
You're welcome.

15:43.480 --> 15:44.530
What a relief.

15:44.920 --> 15:45.920
That's great, auntie.

15:46.210 --> 15:46.730
Don't worry about it.

15:46.730 --> 15:47.560
That's great.

15:53.600 --> 15:54.560
Don't worry.

15:55.680 --> 15:56.920
This lawyer Pan

15:57.040 --> 15:59.210
argued with me all the time when we were at school.

15:59.770 --> 16:01.480
Our friendship had been deeper as we argued more.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.850
Now he is a first-class lawyer in China.

16:06.240 --> 16:07.120
Ye.

16:07.210 --> 16:07.970
Pan.

16:08.650 --> 16:09.560
Long time no see!

16:09.560 --> 16:11.090
Let me introduce him to you.

16:11.210 --> 16:12.410
This is lawyer Pan.

16:13.440 --> 16:14.650
This is my student Ding Xian.

16:15.210 --> 16:16.210
Hi, Lawyer Pan.

16:16.600 --> 16:16.970
Hi.

16:16.970 --> 16:17.800
Take a seat, please.

16:20.120 --> 16:20.970
How is it?

16:22.680 --> 16:25.360
This isn't much of an office.

16:25.800 --> 16:27.890
I don't feel any humanistic and artistic spirit at all.

16:27.890 --> 16:28.770
Hey, stop there.

16:29.090 --> 16:30.360
You have enough time to criticize me later on,

16:31.210 --> 16:32.680
but I ask you here today to talk about proper business.

16:32.850 --> 16:34.040
How's my student?

16:35.000 --> 16:36.800
I have learned about his situation.

16:37.730 --> 16:38.770
After you told me what's going on,

16:38.770 --> 16:39.890
I also did some research.

16:40.770 --> 16:41.560
Right now,

16:41.730 --> 16:44.090
just a few photos and phone records

16:44.440 --> 16:45.730
can't be taken as evidence.

16:46.330 --> 16:47.240
You can rest assured.

16:47.680 --> 16:48.920
He'll be released on bail pending trial.

16:49.210 --> 16:51.360
We'll get to the rest of it when he is released.

17:00.770 --> 17:02.210
You stayed up all night to do your homework again?

17:06.050 --> 17:07.120
Did you finish it?

17:08.450 --> 17:09.450
Not yet.

17:10.239 --> 17:11.200
In the past two days,

17:11.810 --> 17:13.360
you've been running around hospital and school.

17:13.360 --> 17:15.120
I can't bear to see you getting bigger dark circles.

17:16.080 --> 17:16.930
How about this?

17:17.239 --> 17:18.320
I'll ask our teacher

17:18.530 --> 17:19.840
to let you hand in your paper later.

17:21.959 --> 17:22.810
I'm okay.

17:23.080 --> 17:24.080
Don't worry about me.

17:27.650 --> 17:29.239
Stop smiling like that.

17:29.690 --> 17:31.690
It's hurting me.

17:34.080 --> 17:34.810
Let's go.

17:38.960 --> 17:40.000
Thank you.

17:40.450 --> 17:41.080
She's sick.

17:41.080 --> 17:41.960
That's gross.

17:46.960 --> 17:47.930
Do you know that

17:49.650 --> 17:50.690
Zhou Siyue

17:51.530 --> 17:52.600
has been bailed?

17:53.360 --> 17:55.200
Zhou Siyue is really something.

17:55.450 --> 17:56.360
He knew that

17:56.720 --> 17:58.930
we sent the lawyer there.

18:02.240 --> 18:03.240
Boss Ma,

18:04.240 --> 18:06.000
you made a wrong bet from the beginning.

18:08.650 --> 18:10.720
We shouldn't choose Hongguang Technology,

18:11.810 --> 18:13.200
but Zhou Siyue.

18:17.480 --> 18:18.240
Su,

18:19.770 --> 18:21.080
do you have any idea?

18:28.200 --> 18:29.650
Get a good lawyer,

18:30.770 --> 18:32.120
and be ready for the lawsuit.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.290
Boss Ma.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.600
We've already lost.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.050
Ding Xian.

18:47.530 --> 18:48.570
Pan was very efficient.

18:48.840 --> 18:49.960
I have picked up him.

18:51.530 --> 18:53.360
Where are you now? I'll meet you.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.840
Go back to classes now.

18:57.360 --> 19:00.080
Enjoy your class. I'll see you soon.

19:10.810 --> 19:11.410
Okay.

20:00.770 --> 20:01.650
You're home.

20:07.890 --> 20:09.000
What happened? You hit somewhere?

20:13.120 --> 20:15.450
I was just about to get you a blanket,

20:17.200 --> 20:19.810
but, you were asleep and I didn't want to wake you up.

20:21.320 --> 20:22.360
Silly girl.

20:36.480 --> 20:37.410
How is everything going?

20:39.650 --> 20:40.810
We haven't met each other for so long.

20:41.960 --> 20:43.200
Did you miss me?

20:45.840 --> 20:46.770
Yeah.

20:57.240 --> 20:58.320
Zhou Siyue.

21:00.690 --> 21:01.570
Come here.

21:04.290 --> 21:05.530
Let me hug you.

21:28.770 --> 21:29.840
I'm sorry.

21:35.170 --> 21:37.200
I thought I was strong.

21:40.410 --> 21:41.650
This year,

21:43.840 --> 21:45.000
I have been striving to

21:47.770 --> 21:49.120
protect you.

21:55.320 --> 21:56.480
But, I didn't expect

21:56.650 --> 21:58.930
I was the one who concerned you in the end.

22:01.050 --> 22:02.170
I'm sorry, Ding Xian.

22:04.200 --> 22:05.450
I let you down.

22:16.450 --> 22:18.600
How could you let me down?

22:19.720 --> 22:21.240
You gotta trust me,

22:26.410 --> 22:27.450
Zhou Siyue.

22:29.570 --> 22:31.050
I love you so much.

22:33.650 --> 22:36.240
I'll always be with you,

22:37.770 --> 22:39.410
no matter what happens.

22:57.720 --> 22:58.930
Thank you.

23:06.450 --> 23:07.720
What you just said means

23:07.930 --> 23:09.650
Red Horse wanted to get you out, too?

23:10.000 --> 23:11.570
Red Horse wanted to

23:11.720 --> 23:13.080
solve this matter in a low profile.

23:13.690 --> 23:15.000
Because I know too much,

23:15.480 --> 23:16.320
if I'm under arrest,

23:16.320 --> 23:18.200
it won't do them any good.

23:18.530 --> 23:19.690
So, I think

23:20.320 --> 23:22.410
the first one who tried to get me out

23:22.840 --> 23:24.240
must be from Red Horse.

23:24.690 --> 23:26.720
But, the priority now

23:27.080 --> 23:28.840
is to find out the real culprit,

23:29.080 --> 23:31.120
so we can prove your innocence.

23:31.720 --> 23:33.050
When you go back, think carefully

23:33.450 --> 23:35.000
if there is anyone close to you

23:35.200 --> 23:37.170
but holds grudges against you.

23:43.360 --> 23:44.290
What's the wrong?

23:44.530 --> 23:45.600
You look so serious.

23:48.320 --> 23:50.360
Did you go to Su Bocong again?

23:56.530 --> 23:58.050
It's all for you.

24:03.450 --> 24:06.080
Why are you still acting like a child?

24:06.530 --> 24:08.290
I don't want you see him anymore.

24:09.240 --> 24:11.570
I know what he's thinking.

24:15.120 --> 24:16.570
I won't see him anymore.

24:20.410 --> 24:21.410
What's wrong?

24:21.720 --> 24:23.120
Did he do anything to you?

24:25.480 --> 24:26.410
No,

24:27.720 --> 24:28.600
it's just,

24:29.600 --> 24:32.240
looking back, I feel everyone has changed.

24:34.810 --> 24:37.000
We were so close, but,

24:37.960 --> 24:40.570
now we've got nothing to say.

24:44.240 --> 24:46.050
If so, don't talk to him then.

24:49.450 --> 24:51.000
I won't change anyway.

24:53.890 --> 24:54.840
I know.

25:01.290 --> 25:02.530
I've got something to show you.

25:03.290 --> 25:05.320
Wait a moment. I have something to tell you.

25:07.120 --> 25:08.530
Do you remember that I told you

25:08.720 --> 25:11.240
I saw Dong Zhengfei's name in Red Horse?

25:11.240 --> 25:12.240
After that, I went back to school.

25:12.240 --> 25:14.530
One day, I saw him together with Hongguang's people.

25:14.690 --> 25:15.840
I didn't know until I asked others.

25:16.240 --> 25:17.120
The moment you got arrested,

25:17.320 --> 25:19.450
he signed a contract with Hongguang to replace you.

25:19.450 --> 25:20.840
It doesn't make any sense.

25:22.650 --> 25:23.570
What are you doing?

25:23.570 --> 25:25.000
We were thinking about the same thing.

25:26.240 --> 25:27.290
Look.

25:30.720 --> 25:31.960
I compared

25:32.240 --> 25:33.690
the code I wrote

25:33.690 --> 25:34.650
and the code of Red Horse's new products.

25:35.170 --> 25:36.770
Do they look exactly the same at the first glance?

25:38.930 --> 25:40.290
But, look here.

25:42.320 --> 25:44.320
Outdated code-writing like this

25:45.050 --> 25:45.930
could only be written by one person

25:46.170 --> 25:48.080
that's close to me.

25:48.650 --> 25:50.890
And when this project was launched,

25:50.890 --> 25:51.690
it's at school.

25:52.770 --> 25:53.600
So,

25:53.810 --> 25:55.570
the person who had the opportunity to learn about this code

25:55.570 --> 25:56.810
can only be him.

25:57.570 --> 25:59.770
So what are you going to do now?

26:03.770 --> 26:05.530
Wait for him to come to me.

26:57.410 --> 26:58.290
Here you come.

26:59.810 --> 27:01.080
Come and take a look at it for me.

27:02.890 --> 27:05.320
As for program you designed for the robot before,

27:05.930 --> 27:07.480
I still haven't figured it out.

27:09.930 --> 27:10.810
It's you.

27:12.930 --> 27:14.120
I didn't expect that an email

27:14.360 --> 27:15.530
could get you here.

27:17.690 --> 27:20.050
I didn't expect that such a simple trick

27:20.650 --> 27:21.570
would get me hooked, too.

27:22.840 --> 27:23.530
Maybe it's because

27:23.530 --> 27:24.960
I can't solve

27:26.200 --> 27:27.600
the virus code you sent me.

27:28.840 --> 27:30.080
And that made me irrational.

27:32.450 --> 27:33.840
If I didn't come here today,

27:35.600 --> 27:37.360
would you really hack into my computer?

27:38.960 --> 27:41.200
I don't do anything illegal.

27:47.650 --> 27:48.690
You regret it?

27:52.690 --> 27:53.530
Kind of.

27:56.050 --> 27:57.120
To be honest,

27:58.770 --> 28:00.720
I was worried that you wouldn't show up today.

28:01.770 --> 28:03.720
But, I was also afraid that you do.

28:04.530 --> 28:05.480
At this moment,

28:05.930 --> 28:07.650
stop telling me these fancy words.

28:07.810 --> 28:10.450
At this moment, I don't need to lie to you.

28:10.930 --> 28:12.690
Professor Ye told me before that

28:13.690 --> 28:15.120
he thinks highly of you.

28:16.080 --> 28:18.050
He said you like to chase dead ends,

28:18.690 --> 28:19.650
but

28:19.890 --> 28:21.240
you have solid professional skills.

28:22.120 --> 28:23.080
He also said,

28:24.200 --> 28:26.320
if only we could learn from each other.

28:26.530 --> 28:28.000
But, he has always been favoring you.

28:28.930 --> 28:30.170
If you're talking about the quota for going abroad,

28:31.120 --> 28:33.240
Professor Ye actually applied for two quotas.

28:34.650 --> 28:35.770
So, you and I

28:35.770 --> 28:37.960
are never enemies.

28:45.480 --> 28:47.320
Why didn't you say so earlier?

28:50.240 --> 28:51.080
Everything

28:55.000 --> 28:56.120
is too late.

29:04.890 --> 29:05.570
Okay.

29:06.240 --> 29:07.290
Let me explain to you

29:07.720 --> 29:09.170
the program you mentioned.

29:11.890 --> 29:12.690
Later on,

29:12.960 --> 29:14.600
you may not see me for a long time.

29:16.000 --> 29:18.080
It's now or never.

29:18.890 --> 29:20.930
I can be your tutor today.

29:25.120 --> 29:25.960
Okay.

30:00.080 --> 30:02.810
Su, I've got something to tell you.

30:03.410 --> 30:04.410
What a coincidence, Boss Ma.

30:05.080 --> 30:06.200
I also want to tell you something.

30:06.320 --> 30:07.170
Alright.

30:47.690 --> 30:48.720
A cup of cold brewed coffee, please.

30:48.720 --> 30:49.170
Okay.

30:53.450 --> 30:54.690
Do you remember when we were kids,

30:54.690 --> 30:55.770
the coffee we drank for the first time

30:57.080 --> 30:59.530
was brought by the uncle next door from downtown.

31:05.720 --> 31:07.720
My dad said it wouldn't be bitter this way.

31:12.600 --> 31:13.530
Is it still bitter?

31:14.050 --> 31:14.890
No,

31:16.410 --> 31:17.650
it's too sweet.

31:18.360 --> 31:19.290
You try it.

31:19.480 --> 31:21.080
You try it.

31:25.320 --> 31:26.240
Thank you.

31:28.450 --> 31:29.120
When you were a kid, you said

31:29.120 --> 31:30.690
you would never drink this damn thing again.

31:33.890 --> 31:36.240
Yeah, a lot has changed.

31:42.080 --> 31:42.890
No, not really.

31:44.530 --> 31:45.240
Actually,

31:46.170 --> 31:48.840
your outfit is always nice and neat.

31:50.000 --> 31:53.050
Su, why are you going back so soon this time?

31:53.770 --> 31:55.720
I have to hurry back for extra classes during the vacation.

31:56.000 --> 31:56.770
Shen Hai High School has an intensive curriculum.

31:56.930 --> 31:58.360
I may be left behind if I don't try hard.

32:00.200 --> 32:02.410
What is Shen Hai High School like?

32:05.050 --> 32:06.410
I can't describe it in a few words.

32:06.690 --> 32:07.810
Aren't you going to take the entrance exam soon?

32:07.810 --> 32:08.960
You'll know when you are enrolled.

32:10.320 --> 32:11.770
Don't fail the exam then.

32:12.120 --> 32:13.600
How is that possible?

32:13.810 --> 32:15.960
You could pass the exam. So will I.

32:16.170 --> 32:17.000
Not only will I pass,

32:17.360 --> 32:19.600
I will get higher scores than yours.

32:20.290 --> 32:21.120
Okay.

32:21.120 --> 32:23.410
You love to compare yourself with me since you were a child.

32:23.530 --> 32:26.600
But, you have to work harder to catch up with me this time.

32:31.930 --> 32:32.840
That's

32:34.290 --> 32:36.450
the last time we met in junior high school.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.080
After that...

32:39.410 --> 32:40.360
After that,

32:40.840 --> 32:42.290
we met in Shen Hai High School.

32:45.290 --> 32:46.200
To be honest,

32:47.120 --> 32:48.450
I envy you a lot.

32:50.290 --> 32:51.960
We were both admitted to Shen Hai High School.

32:54.170 --> 32:56.320
I always thought your high school life

32:56.570 --> 32:57.770
would be just like mine.

32:58.810 --> 33:00.080
You would feel isolated,

33:01.770 --> 33:02.840
and lonely.

33:08.360 --> 33:09.360
Adolescence

33:11.480 --> 33:12.840
is turbulent.

33:19.290 --> 33:20.530
But, you always have people around you

33:20.530 --> 33:22.170
willing to reach out to you.

33:24.600 --> 33:26.000
I envy you a lot,

33:27.690 --> 33:29.120
and I feel very happy for you, too.

33:35.530 --> 33:36.960
So, you won't be like me,

33:40.290 --> 33:42.200
becoming a bad guy.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.930
You're not a bad guy, Su.

33:49.200 --> 33:51.120
You are also the one who has been reaching out to me.

33:51.930 --> 33:52.890
Isn't it?

33:59.840 --> 34:01.120
After that, I've been missing

34:01.120 --> 34:02.480
our secret base.

34:04.320 --> 34:05.530
I always keep

34:06.000 --> 34:07.200
this photo.

34:16.450 --> 34:17.450
Ding Xian.

34:22.450 --> 34:25.690
I hope you can always smile like this.

34:26.359 --> 34:27.359
I will.

34:29.120 --> 34:31.250
You still smile as the same as at that time.

34:31.970 --> 34:33.520
You can do this too, Su.

34:36.170 --> 34:38.359
You can also go back to the way you used to be.

34:51.210 --> 34:53.120
There's another thing.

35:00.010 --> 35:01.560
Do me a favor. Give this to Zhou Siyue.

35:02.320 --> 35:04.170
This is the information that can help his father.

35:10.280 --> 35:11.600
Why are you looking at me like that?

35:16.410 --> 35:18.210
I actually knew I stand no chance,

35:18.520 --> 35:20.520
but I still don't want to go to your wedding.

35:25.520 --> 35:26.840
It's fine that you don't come,

35:28.560 --> 35:30.650
but don't forget the cash gift.

35:32.410 --> 35:33.730
Cash gift?

35:34.650 --> 35:35.730
It depends on my mood that day.

35:36.410 --> 35:37.800
Why are you so stingy?

35:38.120 --> 35:39.280
How am I stingy?

35:39.690 --> 35:41.320
Do you remember the review materials from high school?

35:49.690 --> 35:51.840
You've been watching it all this while. Are you done?

35:53.120 --> 35:54.930
You like this photo that much?

35:55.170 --> 35:56.800
Don't you think it's nice?

35:57.970 --> 35:59.690
Among all my photos,

35:59.890 --> 36:01.210
this is the nicest.

36:01.690 --> 36:03.210
You look prettier than the picture.

36:03.410 --> 36:05.250
It has nothing to do with the person who took the photo.

36:11.490 --> 36:12.730
I think you're right.

36:20.650 --> 36:22.320
Why didn't you tell me?

36:22.840 --> 36:23.760
It's so close.

36:24.600 --> 36:25.560
It's nice.

36:26.280 --> 36:28.010
I'll be the one to take your photos.

36:30.650 --> 36:31.600
It is nice.

36:31.840 --> 36:33.120
Let's take a picture together.

36:35.170 --> 36:35.970
Alright.

36:36.650 --> 36:37.490
Ready.

36:41.450 --> 36:42.930
One, two.

36:47.170 --> 36:47.840
Look.

36:48.730 --> 36:50.040
You didn't capture that.

36:50.210 --> 36:51.210
I did.

36:52.690 --> 36:54.560
I exercise every day.

36:55.600 --> 36:57.250
-We can exercise together some other day. -Okay.

36:58.040 --> 36:59.410
-Bye. -Bye.

37:00.120 --> 37:01.250
Let me offer you a hand.

37:02.170 --> 37:02.970
No, it's fine.

37:04.040 --> 37:05.170
You guys can get upstairs now.

37:05.170 --> 37:05.890
I'll take care of the rest of it.

37:05.890 --> 37:07.410
-Okay, be careful. -Okay.

37:09.250 --> 37:10.320
It's nice to be back, right?

37:11.760 --> 37:12.890
Zhou Siyue.

37:19.760 --> 37:21.250
Siyue! Siyue!

37:24.410 --> 37:25.600
The key.

37:28.010 --> 37:29.040
Don't do that!

37:31.210 --> 37:32.930
Lazy bone!

37:33.170 --> 37:33.970
Ding Xian.

37:34.410 --> 37:35.410
Why are you standing there?

37:35.730 --> 37:37.650
Move your stuff quickly!

37:40.970 --> 37:41.970
Ding Juncong.

37:52.040 --> 37:53.360
Do you need my help?

38:10.650 --> 38:12.730
What? You don't know your own home?

38:13.800 --> 38:14.690
No.

38:15.450 --> 38:16.410
I thought

38:17.040 --> 38:18.560
I wouldn't come back here again.

38:19.970 --> 38:21.320
You thought

38:21.490 --> 38:23.280
you wouldn't talk to me again back then.

38:28.120 --> 38:29.600
Didn't I apologize for it?

38:30.800 --> 38:33.760
How can you forgive me?

38:42.560 --> 38:43.970
Mom and dad are still here.

38:44.320 --> 38:45.210
Zhou.

38:46.080 --> 38:46.930
Zhou.

38:47.280 --> 38:48.930
-Zhou. -Wencheng, here you come!

38:49.320 --> 38:50.800
Wanxian, why didn't you tell us

38:51.010 --> 38:52.170
that you moved back?

38:52.360 --> 38:54.520
I was thinking about cleaning the house first

38:54.760 --> 38:55.970
and inviting you over for dinner.

38:55.970 --> 38:57.650
Right, I didn't want to bother you before.

38:58.250 --> 38:59.040
It's also their summer vacation.

38:59.410 --> 39:01.170
Xianxian and Siyue are both home.

39:01.360 --> 39:03.210
Let's make time and get together.

39:03.250 --> 39:04.010
Right, get together at my house.

39:04.010 --> 39:05.170
-Siyue. -We came to your house

39:05.170 --> 39:06.320
to help you arrange stuff.

39:06.690 --> 39:07.410
Let me help you.

39:07.520 --> 39:08.840
Just leave it there.

39:12.520 --> 39:13.560
Xianxian.

39:13.760 --> 39:14.600
Siyue.

39:18.890 --> 39:19.760
What's wrong with Siyue?

39:19.970 --> 39:22.080
I was moving stuff and sprained my ankle.

39:22.320 --> 39:23.560
Really? Let me check.

39:23.560 --> 39:24.560
-Check him. -No, it's fine.

39:24.560 --> 39:25.120
I'll get you some medicine.

39:25.120 --> 39:26.890
I'll help you.

39:27.600 --> 39:28.520
Leave it there.

39:28.930 --> 39:29.970
-You can't move it yourself. -Are you okay?

39:29.970 --> 39:31.250
-Are you okay? -I feel much better.

39:35.210 --> 39:36.840
Siyue finally moved back?

39:39.170 --> 39:40.800
Where are his parents?

39:41.760 --> 39:43.600
They went out to play mahjong with my parents.

39:48.010 --> 39:48.840
Shadi.

39:49.450 --> 39:50.280
Look.

39:54.360 --> 39:55.760
When did she post that?

39:57.520 --> 39:58.760
I was wondering why Jiang Chen

39:58.930 --> 40:00.600
insisted on traveling with Keke.

40:01.250 --> 40:03.210
It turned out he had a plan.

40:03.650 --> 40:04.490
That's great.

40:05.970 --> 40:07.170
It's nice.

40:09.730 --> 40:12.250
It must look very good on my hands.

40:13.120 --> 40:14.170
If you like it so much,

40:14.450 --> 40:16.280
ask Song Ziqi to buy you one.

40:16.490 --> 40:17.840
Stop talking about me.

40:18.360 --> 40:19.410
How long are you going to hide it

40:19.600 --> 40:21.120
from his parents?

40:23.320 --> 40:24.840
What are you worried about?

40:25.120 --> 40:27.210
His parents like you.

40:28.650 --> 40:29.560
Yeah,

40:30.360 --> 40:33.800
but we need a right timing.

40:34.210 --> 40:35.280
Their family has finally

40:35.490 --> 40:37.080
settled down.

40:38.490 --> 40:39.930
We'll talk about it later.

40:41.360 --> 40:42.250
Don't worry about me.

40:42.450 --> 40:43.890
Worry about yourself.

40:46.560 --> 40:48.760
Song Ziqi, check your phone.

40:52.280 --> 40:53.650
Hold on. I'll defeat you in next round.

40:54.410 --> 40:55.930
You said it in last round.

41:01.930 --> 41:03.120
Jiang Chen really got something.

41:03.970 --> 41:05.040
They're getting married.

41:06.080 --> 41:07.760
I told him it would be successful.

41:07.760 --> 41:08.890
He was so nervous.

41:09.520 --> 41:10.450
You knew it?

41:12.410 --> 41:14.280
Then why didn't he tell me?

41:14.890 --> 41:17.120
He told me you had a big mouth.

41:17.280 --> 41:19.080
If he told you, the whole world would know it.

41:19.650 --> 41:21.520
I have to research how much he spent on it.

41:22.930 --> 41:23.840
What's going on?

41:24.170 --> 41:25.280
You are in a hurry, too?

41:27.170 --> 41:29.360
Hey, do you know why that little madam

41:29.560 --> 41:30.930
asked me to see this?

41:30.930 --> 41:31.930
That is a hint.

41:42.170 --> 41:43.320
So expensive.

41:44.840 --> 41:46.930
I have to save money from now on.

41:48.600 --> 41:50.320
You're thinking quite much.

41:50.800 --> 41:52.010
I call it taking precautions.

41:52.360 --> 41:54.730
Maybe I'll get it done faster than you.

41:55.600 --> 41:57.450
Why so?

41:59.010 --> 42:01.360
Look. Isn't your father just recovered?

42:01.760 --> 42:02.840
You have to wait

42:03.010 --> 42:05.040
for the right timing.

42:06.450 --> 42:07.730
Why should I wait?

42:08.690 --> 42:10.320
I was too busy before.

42:10.520 --> 42:11.410
So, I didn't tell them.

42:11.930 --> 42:13.010
I plan

42:13.250 --> 42:15.250
to tell them directly this time.

42:16.210 --> 42:18.250
I'll get it done quicker than you anyway.

42:19.600 --> 42:20.600
Impossible.

42:20.930 --> 42:22.280
Impossible?

42:25.250 --> 42:28.010
Go, go, go.

42:32.930 --> 42:34.120
It's full of memories.

42:36.690 --> 42:37.560
Come here.

42:47.840 --> 42:48.760
Hey,

42:49.450 --> 42:50.410
you're from Shen Hai High School?

42:50.600 --> 42:51.410
Right.

42:52.170 --> 42:53.210
Me, too.

42:54.360 --> 42:55.320
Hi, senior.

42:56.930 --> 42:58.800
This is my deskmate.

42:59.280 --> 43:00.210
Hi, senior.

43:01.650 --> 43:03.250
Seniors, we have to go.

43:03.650 --> 43:04.970
Goodbye.

43:10.040 --> 43:11.320
It's so childish.

43:12.170 --> 43:13.120
What's wrong?

43:13.760 --> 43:15.520
Let them envy us.

43:17.450 --> 43:20.600
When you grow up, you can just show it.

43:27.210 --> 43:29.170
I'll take you to visit my parents later.

43:33.010 --> 43:34.800
All of a sudden?

43:35.170 --> 43:36.250
All of a sudden?

43:37.280 --> 43:38.840
I didn't plan to hide it.

43:40.170 --> 43:41.170
No.

43:41.970 --> 43:44.280
Your dad just got recovered.

43:46.010 --> 43:46.970
What if

43:47.210 --> 43:50.320
your mom and dad don't like me?

43:51.760 --> 43:53.320
Are you still worried about this?

43:54.170 --> 43:55.560
Don't they treat you well?

43:55.800 --> 43:56.600
They do,

43:57.890 --> 43:59.520
but that's different.

43:59.930 --> 44:01.040
Before,

44:02.120 --> 44:03.690
we were friends.

44:04.080 --> 44:06.650
Now, I'm your girlfriend.

44:07.320 --> 44:10.600
What if they think I'm not good enough for you?

44:13.280 --> 44:14.280
What are you talking about?

44:20.320 --> 44:21.410
Ding Xian.

44:22.410 --> 44:25.080
Being with you is my greatest blessing.

44:26.450 --> 44:28.560
It's me who is not good enough for you.

44:31.970 --> 44:33.170
Also,

44:33.760 --> 44:35.520
my mom liked you so much back then.

44:36.080 --> 44:37.730
When I saw that, I was jealous.

44:38.170 --> 44:39.170
You think too much.

44:44.840 --> 44:47.250
I didn't expect you, Zhou Siyue,

44:47.760 --> 44:49.730
to say something like that.

44:52.360 --> 44:53.560
You're right.

44:54.210 --> 44:56.410
I'm so cute.

44:56.890 --> 44:58.690
Auntie must like me.

44:59.520 --> 45:01.800
Your mindset changed so quickly.

45:02.360 --> 45:04.450
Don't be so proud.

45:05.490 --> 45:06.890
Didn't you say that

45:07.520 --> 45:11.600
being with me is the greatest blessing?

45:15.930 --> 45:17.170
Around this time before,

45:17.730 --> 45:19.800
kids would all be home from school.

45:20.840 --> 45:23.490
It feels like it was yesterday.

45:24.520 --> 45:26.730
They all grew up in an instant.

45:26.730 --> 45:27.520
Yeah.

45:28.170 --> 45:29.800
You can chill now.

45:30.170 --> 45:31.730
I still have to look after the kid.

45:33.650 --> 45:35.800
When Xianxian gets married and gives birth,

45:36.120 --> 45:37.040
as a grandmother,

45:37.210 --> 45:38.600
I have to look after my grandchild.

45:39.040 --> 45:40.450
It's endless.

45:42.280 --> 45:42.930
Married?

45:44.280 --> 45:46.930
Xianxian has a boyfriend?

45:48.650 --> 45:50.120
Siyue didn't tell you?

45:53.600 --> 45:54.600
No.

45:56.280 --> 45:58.120
You know Siyue.

45:58.490 --> 46:00.280
He likes to hide everything in his heart.

46:06.360 --> 46:07.360
Do you remember that

46:07.760 --> 46:10.320
when they were young, we arranged their marriage.

46:10.520 --> 46:13.280
Yeah, that was when they were kids.

46:13.280 --> 46:14.410
It's years ago.

46:15.010 --> 46:16.170
The old people at that time

46:16.170 --> 46:18.120
liked to arrange marriages.

46:18.120 --> 46:19.450
It doesn't count now.

46:20.760 --> 46:21.600
Besides,

46:23.080 --> 46:24.360
you know our family's situation.

46:25.410 --> 46:27.520
We can't be your burden.

46:29.490 --> 46:30.800
Yeah, it's arranged when they were kids.

46:31.250 --> 46:32.560
It doesn't count.

46:33.450 --> 46:34.210
Right?

46:35.040 --> 46:36.320
Right.

46:47.120 --> 46:48.800
They really broke off the engagement?

46:49.080 --> 46:50.970
It's not really so.

46:51.560 --> 46:52.800
My mom was saying that

46:53.080 --> 46:55.040
what they said before doesn't count.

46:56.760 --> 46:58.080
I was wondering why my mom came home

46:58.280 --> 46:59.730
with a worried face.

47:00.840 --> 47:02.690
It turned out that it was because of this.

47:04.410 --> 47:05.930
So what now?

47:07.760 --> 47:08.490
I don't know why my mom

47:08.690 --> 47:10.080
was like that all of a sudden.

47:10.690 --> 47:11.970
We can only

47:12.800 --> 47:14.450
take one step at a time.

47:15.010 --> 47:16.930
I knew it wouldn't go smoothly.

47:18.010 --> 47:19.800
Since she wanted to break off the child engagement,

47:20.760 --> 47:23.520
it means she disagrees with us being together.

47:25.840 --> 47:28.170
Hey, don't overthink.

47:28.730 --> 47:30.760
Aren't you sleepy? Go to bed first.

47:31.010 --> 47:33.170
How can I still fall asleep?

47:35.560 --> 47:37.690
How about going to bed now

47:38.250 --> 47:39.840
and I'll take you somewhere when you wake up tomorrow?

47:43.520 --> 47:44.560
Good night then.

47:44.890 --> 47:45.730
Good night.
